{
  "uid": "orders-observability",
  "title": "Pedidos — observabilidade",
  "description": "Metricas de negocio e tecnicas da aplicacao metrics-observability. Cada painel tem a descricao do porque da metrica, nao so do que ela mostra.",
  "tags": [
    "micrometer",
    "prometheus",
    "orders"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pedidos aceitos por minuto, por canal",
      "description": "A metrica que nenhum framework entrega pronta. Heap e CPU dizem se a JVM esta viva; esta diz se a empresa esta vendendo. Sempre via rate(): o valor absoluto de um counter nao responde nenhuma pergunta.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (channel) (rate(orders_accepted_total[1m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{channel}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Fila de pedidos pendentes",
      "description": "Gauge: uma leitura instantanea, amostrada no scrape. Sobe e desce. Nao serve para contar eventos - tudo que acontecer entre dois scrapes e invisivel.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "orders_pending_orders",
          "legendFormat": "pendentes",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cumprimento do SLO (300 ms)",
      "description": "A fracao de pedidos processados dentro do objetivo, lida direto de um bucket. Precisa porque existe um bucket exatamente em 300 ms - esse e o motivo de escolher os limites pelo SLO e nao aceitar os defaults. O limiar tracejado e o objetivo: a linha abaixo dele e exatamente o que a regra ProcessingSloBurn dispara.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.95
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "max": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(orders_processing_seconds_bucket{le=\"0.3\"}[5m])) / sum(rate(orders_processing_seconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "dentro do objetivo",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia de processamento (percentis do histograma)",
      "description": "Percentil calculado NO PROMETHEUS a partir dos buckets. E o unico jeito de ter um p95 do servico inteiro: a media dos p95 de tres instancias nao e o p95 do conjunto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(orders_processing_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(orders_processing_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(orders_processing_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Falhas de pagamento por motivo",
      "description": "A dimensao vem de um enum fechado. Taguear pela mensagem crua do gateway e vazamento de cardinalidade: basta o provedor incluir um id na mensagem para cada falha virar uma serie.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "ops",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(orders_payment_failures_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Distribuicao do valor dos pedidos",
      "description": "DistributionSummary: a mesma ideia do Timer para uma grandeza que nao e tempo. Um counter de receita total diz 'quanto'; isto diz 'como esta espalhado' - mil pedidos de um real e um pedido de mil reais somam igual.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "currencyBRL",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(orders_amount_BRL_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "mediana",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.90, sum by (le) (rate(orders_amount_BRL_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p90",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "pluginVersion": "11.1.0"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia HTTP p95 por rota",
      "description": "Metrica que o Actuator publica sozinho. A tag uri e o caminho com template (/orders/{id}), nao o resolvido - e o que impede uma serie por id de pedido.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          },
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
